(7664554, 1250003, 30049, '<td valign="top">Lovely Filly, but the image is WAY too overprocessed IMO.  The detail has been mostly washed out with noise reduction it seems.</td>', 'Lovely Filly, but the image is WAY too overprocessed IMO.  The detail has been mostly washed out with noise reduction it seems.', '2020-05-30 16:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7664555, 1250034, 30049, '<td valign="top">I might have gone with a 4x5 ratio instead of 4x6 on this.  Nonetheless, it''s a wonderful capture.  I bet this would look great in a larger presentation!</td>', 'I might have gone with a 4x5 ratio instead of 4x6 on this.  Nonetheless, it''s a wonderful capture.  I bet this would look great in a larger presentation!', '2020-05-30 16:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7664556, 1249721, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  Might have been tempted to go with a more pano type crop to eliminate the dead space at top (washed out sky).  The biggest thing that I notice is the white balance, it seems overly warm with strong yellow hues.</td>', 'Nice capture.  Might have been tempted to go with a more pano type crop to eliminate the dead space at top (washed out sky).  The biggest thing that I notice is the white balance, it seems overly warm with strong yellow hues.', '2020-05-30 16:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
